   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity to influence for a living wage, harassment free workplace and FoA, through social dialogue</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">STITCH will strengthen the capacity of partner TU and LROs in production countries. We focus on collective bargaining, L&amp;A, organising (via social media and a social dialogue app), negotiation skills, Planning/Monitoring/Evaluation/Learning (PMEL), mutual learning, and financial sustainability. We emphasise security training for activists and organisations, including digital security. Through social dialogue, TUs and LROs will be better equipped to influence a living wage, a harassment-free workplace, and FoA.</narrative>
   </description>
