  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">TUs/ LROs have increased representation of garment workers</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">TUs and LROs will be able to voice their concerns without fearing violence or restrictions. In an expanded civic space, TUs advance workers&#x2019; rights, especially FoA and the right to decent work. TUs and LROs in production countries are free to organise unions or worker-representative organisations, with women in leadership.</narrative>
   </description>
